      "message": "Won\u0027t this break message boundaries with LE L2CAP CoC SDUs? The CoC feature is supposed to be message based (SDUs), not byte based like TCP. With SOCK_SEQPACKET, the message boundaries are correctly preserved even up to the public Java layer. I\u0027m pretty sure SOCK_STREAM would break this.",
